    "body": "Quick pass done on 7e8d92cf. **Stacked on #1098: merge #1098 first** (its head 6440858b is this branch's base, unchanged).\n- Merges cleanly with main. Upstream main has moved 7 commits (UI and process only, none in the rapid law) since #1098's base.\n- `cargo xtask gate batch` on 7e8d92cf: all green, clippy `-D warnings` included. Pinning tests: `stepped_stock_link` (3) and the 5 new `sim::verify::stock_top::tests`. #1098's own suites stay green.\n- The body is complete: what changed, how it was tested, what was not exercised, `Changelog:`, `Fixes #1095`.\n- Laws: no `unwrap`/`expect`/`panic!` in this commit's source, no snapshot PNG touched, touched files under 400 lines, a decision file. One #1098 pin changes by design (`only_upright_column_dives_are_re_read`), as the body says.\n\nFlagging ready for review. It changes the rapid-in-stock law (under the safety floor), so per the effort table the review should run at the high tier.",
