    "body": "This conflicts with main. The conflicting hunk is one line in `crates/sim/src/verify/stock_top.rs` and both sides changed the same `clear_of(...)` call differently (yours: `(c, c)` with `m.to.z`; main: `c` with `m.to.z - e`) - same-logic on both sides, so it needs your judgement, not an automated keep-both. The cause is that #1098, which this was stacked on, merged into main (0fc30b65) - please `git merge upstream/main` into the branch and push. Heads-up: since #911 `sim::verify::VerifyContext` carries a `model_excess` field, so any test that builds one needs `..Default::default()` to compile against current main.\n",
